```bash
./md.x parameters > out.dat
./md.nocorr.x parameters > out_nocorr.dat

gnuplot
p 'out.dat' u 1:6 w l lw 2 t 'COM corrected', 'out_nocorr.dat' u 1:6 w l lw 3 t 'no COM corr.'
```

stats are available via
```gnuplot
stats 'filename' using $columnnumber$
```

move legend via
```gnuplot
set key bottom right
```